]{name=inflation, column=3, between=row6 and row11}{
  \fontsize{28}{36}\selectfont
  \begin{itemize}[itemsep=8pt]
    \item Global headline inflation on a declining trajectory through 2026, enabling the ``policy pivot''
    \item US inflation remains above target longer than peer economies --- services inflation especially sticky
    \item Renewed inflationary pressures emerged by April 2026, linked to defense spending and supply disruptions
    \item Central banks began easing from late 2024, but the path is uneven across advanced economies
  \end{itemize}
  \vspace{2mm}
  \colorbox{primary!18}{\parbox{0.92\linewidth}{%
