  \fontsize{26}{34}\selectfont\color{textdark}
  \begin{enumerate}[itemsep=8pt, label={\color{white}\bfseries\arabic*.}]
    \item \textbf{Persistent mediocrity:} Global growth oscillates in a narrow 3.0--3.3\% band, failing to recover to the pre-pandemic 3.8\% trend
    \item \textbf{Downside dominance:} Across every WEO edition, risk assessments are tilted to the downside --- trade policy, geopolitics, and sticky inflation
    \item \textbf{Policy pivot under strain:} The shift from fiscal buffers to defense-spending trade-offs reflects a world with less policy space and more demands
  \end{enumerate}
